>>>>> ch19
>>>>> ch20
>>>>>      855225  822825  615382  543041  499101  556394  464686  482359
>>>>> 375259
>>>>> 450685
>>>>>        ch21    ch22     chX     chY    chMT
>>>>>      253480  244482  445596   53908     667
